WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — The Last Message — Episode 9 — English subtitles — the ACTUAL spoken dialogue, transcribed from the video audio (language: en)
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-23 from the real episode audio (whisper-tiny + manual cleanup).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.480
I hereby authorize Layla to inherit the main property located at Alman Sua Street,

2
00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:09.890
as stated in Clause 3 of the Will.

3
00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:13.330
The old house belongs to Layla and Sarah together,

4
00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:20.060
but there is one strange condition written by their late mother.

5
00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:23.300
The house will go to the sister who forgives first.

6
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:33.220
I can never forgive 30 years of lying, Sen. I'm in Elkha Deep.

7
00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:37.710
Already lost my whole life waiting!

8
00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:40.270
Please, both of you, let's not...

9
00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:48.950
There's a second condition, seven days.

10
00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:53.030
If neither sister forgives within seven days,

11
00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:56.270
the house goes to the one man who must never enter it.
